==== hyperbricks yaml {!{api_fragment}} ====
api_fragment:
  - type: api_fragment_render
  - endpoint: https://example.com/fragment
  - method: POST
  - route: api-fragment
==== explainer ====
HTTP method to use for API calls, GET POST PUT DELETE etc...
